## 🚀 Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/Morning-Job-Agent.git
cd Morning-Job-Agent

python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

cp .env.example .env             # then fill in the values you want to use

streamlit run app.py
```

The app works **out of the box with zero configuration** — without a Gemini key
it uses a deterministic fallback summarizer, and without SMTP credentials the
email digest button simply explains that email is disabled.

---

## 🔑 Environment variables

| Variable | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GEMINI_API_KEY` | No | Enables real AI summaries. Without it, fallback summaries are used. |
| `GEMINI_MODEL` | No | Defaults to `gemini-1.5-flash`. |
| `SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_PORT`, `SMTP_USER`, `SMTP_PASSWORD` | No | Enables the email digest feature. |
| `SMTP_USE_TLS` | No | Defaults to `true`. |
| `EMAIL_RECIPIENT` | No | Who receives the digest. |
| `REMOTEOK_URL` | No | Defaults to the public RemoteOK API. |
| `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` | No | HTTP timeout for job fetching. Defaults to `15`. |
| `MAX_JOBS_PER_RUN` | No | Cap on jobs fetched per run. Defaults to `40`. |
| `SCHEDULER_HOUR`, `SCHEDULER_MINUTE` | No | Daily run time. Defaults to `8:00`. |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | No | Defaults to `INFO`. |

See [`.env.example`](.env.example) for a ready-to-copy template.

